WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.292
Along the Nile, life followed the river.

00:00:03.292 --> 00:00:15.887
Farmers watched the sky for the flood, scribes recorded grain and taxes, builders raised stone toward heaven, and priests kept the calendar of festivals.

00:00:15.887 --> 00:00:27.000
Rich and poor alike lived by seasons of flood and harvest — and all believed that order, maat, held the world together against chaos.

